    ["GetTrainerServiceDescription(142)"] = "1: string Creates a Major Spellstone which can be used to enchant your weapon with Shadow, increasing your spell haste by 2% and the damage done by your Shadow spells by up to 21.\r\n\r\nConjured items disappear if logged out for more than 15 minutes.",
