    ["GetTrainerServiceDescription(45)"] = "1: string Creates a Lesser Firestone which can be used to enchant your weapon with Fire, increasing your spell critical strike chance by 1% and the damage done by your Fire spells by up to 10.\r\n\r\nConjured items disappear if logged out for more than 15 minutes.",
